<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - McDonnell Douglas.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - McDonnell Douglas.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs cut its rating on McDonnell Douglas Corp to market perform from trading buy, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 4-3/4 at 52.</p>
</text>
